# Git

- Commit only when the user asks. Do not change git config.
- Never add `Co-authored-by`, `Made-with`, `Generated-by`, or any tool/AI author.
- If a hook or UI appends those trailers, strip them before the commit lands.
- Never stage `no-push/` or secrets (`.env`).
- No `--no-verify`, force push to main/master, or hard reset unless the user explicitly asks.
